## Follow straightest possible motion

Geodesics solve a smooth coupled differential system rather than switching formulas on diagonal boundaries. Learn more about [geodesics](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geodesic) and numerical [Runge–Kutta methods](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Runge%E2%80%93Kutta_methods).

