{{algorithm:2}}

<details><summary>Reveal the connection coefficients</summary>
The independent nonzero entries are $\Gamma^1_{12}=-\tanh y$, $\Gamma^1_{22}=-\cosh^2y\cosh x\sinh x$, $\Gamma^2_{11}=\sinh y/(\cosh^3y\cosh^2x)$, and $\Gamma^2_{12}=\tanh x$; lower-index symmetry supplies the paired entries.
</details>

The corrected picture is a smooth anisotropic plane, flat at one point and negatively curved everywhere else.
